{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00404","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 肃和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"止奏潜聆，登仪宿啭。\n太玉躬奉，参锺首奠。\n簠簋聿昇，牺牲遰荐。\n昭事顒若，存存以俔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}